(7662784, 1249085, 94815, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and what a surprise blue for a 5.8 fractional. Must be the lowest ribbon score on record.<br/>Mita has it right about multiple pinholes. <br/>I did quite a bit of testing and settled on three in-line holes in a sheet of aluminum foil stretched over the lens mount in place of the lens: one hole in the middle and one at each edge although badly aligned in this case.<br/>Thanks all.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and what a surprise blue for a 5.8 fractional. Must be the lowest ribbon score on record.Mita has it right about multiple pinholes. I did quite a bit of testing and settled on three in-line holes in a sheet of aluminum foil stretched over the lens mount in place of the lens: one hole in the middle and one at each edge although badly aligned in this case.Thanks all.', '2020-05-17 02:06:27.000000', NULL, 0),
