(7662823, 1249085, 123833, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Venser:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tvsometime:</b></div><hr/><i>Must be the lowest ribbon score on record.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>It is, and only blue ribbon ever under 6.00. <br/>The four lowest blue ribbons on record are all minimal editing challenges. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>How did you work this out?? It looks like almost after 10 years at DPC I still don''t know all the functionality of the website.<br/> <br/>PS I did work it out, it should be telling us something. Maybe finally get rid of Minimal challenges? It is pretty clear that the voters don''t like them.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-05-17 12:29:30.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Venser: Originally posted by tvsometime:Must be the lowest ribbon score on record. It is, and only blue ribbon ever under 6.00. The four lowest blue ribbons on record are all minimal editing challenges.  How did you work this out?? It looks like almost after 10 years at DPC I still don''t know all the functionality of the website. PS I did work it out, it should be telling us something. Maybe finally get rid of Minimal challenges? It is pretty clear that the voters don''t like them.', '2020-05-17 13:25:25.000000', '2020-05-17 13:29:30.000000', 0),
(7662824, 1249156, 30049, '<td valign="top">FWIW - This was my top pick for this challenge.  Had no idea they actually made a lens for this effect.  Makes sense I guess since I do own a couple of Lensbaby lens.<br/> <br/><a href="https://thingyfy.com/pps/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Thingyfy</a></td>', 'FWIW - This was my top pick for this challenge.  Had no idea they actually made a lens for this effect.  Makes sense I guess since I do own a couple of Lensbaby lens. Thingyfy', '2020-05-17 13:29:55.000000', NULL, 0),
